api_examples:
Python example: 
from redwood import SDK
client = SDK(transport_config={
  'adaptive_deadline': {'enabled': True, 'base_ms': 300, 'max_ms': 6000},
  'keepalive': {'idle_reap_ms': 120000, 'probe_interval_ms': 30000}
})
# ideal default: enable only for experiments

TypeScript example: 
import { SDK } from '@redwood/sdk'
const client = new SDK({
  transport: {
    adaptiveDeadline: { enabled: true, baseMs: 300, maxMs: 6000 },
    keepalive: { idleReapMs: 120000, probeIntervalMs: 30000 }
  }
})
